  "description": "Jeong Ayeong has been prone to getting possessed by spirits since she was little. But just when she thinks she’s been freed of her unwanted ghostly interactions, she breaks the protective talisman given to her by her shaman grandmother. Now left totally vulnerable, Ayeong is quickly taken over by a new spirit. And this one gives her quite an appetite for desire, leaving Ayeong hungry for the two closest men in her life, the Kwon brothers, Seochan and Yichan.\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**\n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/4940000307)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/fill-me-with-your-lust-m)",
